WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.070
Water is wonderful!

2
00:00:04.071 --> 00:00:08.534
Do you know why?

3
00:00:08.535 --> 00:00:12.853
We all need water to wash our hands and faces.

4
00:00:12.854 --> 00:00:17.385
Water is wonderful!

5
00:00:17.386 --> 00:00:20.739
Mommy needs water to make lemonade.

6
00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:25.563
Water is wonderful!

7
00:00:25.564 --> 00:00:29.907
Farmers need water to grow fruits and vegetables.

8
00:00:29.908 --> 00:00:34.129
Water is wonderful!

9
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.814
Dams need water to make electricity.

10
00:00:37.815 --> 00:00:42.311
Water is wonderful!

11
00:00:42.312 --> 00:00:46.338
Firefighters need water to put out fires.

12
00:00:46.339 --> 00:00:50.782
Water is wonderful!

13
00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:54.323
People need water to be healthy.

14
00:00:54.324 --> 00:01:00.195
Water is wonderful!

15
00:01:00.196 --> 00:01:02.487
We need water to swim.

16
00:01:02.488 --> 00:01:07.428
Water is wonderful!

17
00:01:07.429 --> 00:01:09.769
Fish need water to breathe.

18
00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:14.755
Water is wonderful!

19
00:01:14.756 --> 00:01:17.825
Water helps us in many ways.

20
00:01:17.826 --> 00:01:24.346
So we need to keep our water clean.

